OL,3,GNEWSATrial for man accused of Chloe
OL,4,AMitchell murder to begin in November
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new trial date has been set for a man
OL,7,Faccused of murdering Chloe Mitchell in
OL,8,FBallymena.
OL,10,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James
OL,11,FStreet in the town, denies murdering
OL,12,Fthe 21-year-old on 3 June 2023 and
OL,13,Fpreventing the lawful burial of her
OL,14,Fremains.
OL,16,FThe judge set a new trial date for 3
OL,17,FNovember at Belfast Crown Court on
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
