OL,3,GNEWSATrial for man accused of Chloe
OL,4,AMitchell murder to begin in November
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court was told a Crown medical
OL,7,Fexpert would have two more meetings
OL,8,Fwith Rainey, 30, during September
OL,9,Fbefore completing her report.
